{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1571184000, "end_date": 1571875199, "month_true_total": 65, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:53:09 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55730126", "author": {"steamid": "76561198446534181", "personaname": "你是疯儿我是傻", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198446534181/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 199628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7697, "last_played": 1779022823, "avatar": "1f95833981860b5c93a5215e944eb836929cd64a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "非常好玩的一款开黑挖矿打怪FPS游戏，游戏角色与语音很带感！", "timestamp_created": 1571834656, "timestamp_updated": 1571834656, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510258615016937256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55698457", "author": {"steamid": "76561198315802611", "personaname": "欧阳铁柱", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198315802611/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 13325, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8123, "last_played": 1701954512, "avatar": "6641e75b8730bc462b567a35cb525ffc85931fcb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "很好玩的游戏", "timestamp_created": 1571635092, "timestamp_updated": 1571635092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55649628", "author": {"steamid": "76561198218398344", "personaname": "Mu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Aimuyo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3010, "last_played": 1722840217, "avatar": "dcc842540aede4b5e7d0963bd59ce22c7c406802"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "耗be香", "timestamp_created": 1571370789, "timestamp_updated": 1571370789, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55643456", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043561245", "personaname": "マジンガーゼロ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043561245/", "num_games_owned": 491, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 129810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 77812, "last_played": 1780928812, "avatar": "cce38b7773f80acb984f067def93e2518aa97f58"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "多余的话不想说，看我的游戏时间就知道了", "timestamp_created": 1571329663, "timestamp_updated": 1642870421, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55642760", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402061770", "personaname": "LilitleQueen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LilitleQueen/", "num_games_owned": 7793, "num_reviews": 1086, "playtime_forever": 282, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 282, "last_played": 1571053245, "avatar": "9fbbb1ecdec7c3be66808748b125a47528b1bed9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "《Deep Rock Galactic》是一款科幻题材的第一人称射击游戏，玩家将扮演矮人族宇航员在各种星球的洞穴中挖矿，同时抵御异虫的攻击。游戏的背景风格偏卡通，并且本作最大的特色就是所有背景都可破坏，在自由度上非常之高。\n\n[h1] 主要玩法\t[/h1]\n本作虽然可以进行单人模式，但是体验比较差，因此有一期组队的好友非常重要。游戏目前共有4种职业，分别为枪手、侦察兵、工程师和推进兵，在任务开始之前玩家们要协商分配职业，最后组成一个完整的小队。\n枪手：武器为加特林，小队中的主力输出，在抵御虫潮掩护队友挖矿的同时还能提供护盾，是一个攻守兼备的角色。\n侦察兵：随身只会携带轻武器防身，但是辅助道具最多，利用照明弹为洞穴提供视野，搜寻资源点和虫穴。\n工程师：武器最为高科技，但同样也比较难用，可以设置炮台，使用火箭弹等等，但是最重要的还是维修技能。\n推进兵：顾名思义，用来挖路的，参与感比较差，但依然是团队不可或缺的一员，主要使用铁锹和炸弹。\n游戏中的任务几乎都是挖矿，虽然这是一款第一人称射击游戏，但是能够避免战斗的话还是要尽量避开虫潮。在完成任务后可以在飞船中提升自身属性、护盾强度、战斗特效和武器研发等等。除了飞船中的任务之外，还可以在娱乐设施中进行小游戏消遣，矮人狂欢夜的气氛十足。\n\n[h1] 游戏体验\t[/h1]\n本作的单机体验很差，玩家必须一人同时扮演4个职位，同时本作几乎没有新手引导，导致玩家还需要花很长一段时间进行摸索阶段。同时4个职业的武器的混用难度极高，辅助道具也集齐一身，对于新手玩家来说极不友好，因此建议入坑时找好人带。多人模式下体验良好，4个职业分工明确，玩法各异，但是任务却相对单调，收集资源占了绝大多数。在体验完全部的玩法后比较容易产生疲劳，游戏到后期主要目标都是不断强化。除了收集任务外，还有一些讨伐任务，敌人几乎都是异虫，但是虫子的设计还是十分有特色的，在卡通的游戏风格下有着不错的科幻感。\n\n[h1] 总体评价\t[/h1]\n本作有着较好的联机体验，但是内容上还有些空洞，目前几乎没有剧情，也没有新手引导，因此有一起联机的好友格外重要。游戏的可玩性较高，但是后期重复读也相对较高，期待正式发售时能有更多的玩法。\n\n[code]欢迎参观我的： [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33217084]真实评测[/url]\n喜欢这篇评论，也麻烦点个赞，让更多人能够看到。[/code]", "timestamp_created": 1571326460, "timestamp_updated": 1571326460, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.516347527503967285", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}